				<r3d:description language="eng">The Landcare Research DataStore (&#039;the DataStore&#039;) is the general data catalogue and repository for Environmental Research Data from Landcare Research.
Much of Landcare Research’s research data is available through specific web pages, but many datasets sit outside these areas. This data repository provides a mechanism for our staff to deposit and document this wider range of datasets so that they may be discovered and potentially re-used.</r3d:description>
